<view class="page backup-page"><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner">本地演练 · 只备份当前演练数据</view><view class="eyebrow">把厨房里的积累，留在自己手里</view><view class="title">备份与恢复</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">备份当前厨房</view><view class="muted">包括你有权查看的完整菜谱、饭局记录及图片。内部参考价只按你的当前权限导出，文件可能含私人备注，请妥善保管。</view><view class="form-row"><text>包含图片</text><switch checked="{{includeImages}}" bindchange="images" disabled="{{busy}}" color="#244B3B"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="create" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">生成可带走的备份</button><view class="muted">较大的厨房会拆成多个ZIP分卷，请全部保存。备份是导出时的副本，不会随云端自动更新。</view></view><view wx:if="{{progress}}" class="note">{{progress}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error-note">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{files.length}}" class="section-title">本机已生成的文件</view><view class="card compact" wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="path"><view class="file-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.records}} 条记录 · {{item.size}} 字节</view><view class="row"><button class="secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="favorite">收藏到微信</button><button class="secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="share">发送或另存</button></view><button class="link-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeFile">删除本机副本</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">从备份恢复菜谱</view><view class="muted">从微信文件中选择ZIP分卷。可以先把收藏中的文件发送到自己的聊天，再选择它。恢复到一间新厨房，不覆盖已有菜谱；同批次其他分卷可继续恢复到这间厨房。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="select" disabled="{{busy}}">选择备份文件</button><block wx:if="{{preview}}"><view class="backup-preview">{{preview.name}} · 分卷 {{preview.part}}</view><view class="muted">本卷 {{preview.recipes}} 道菜谱、{{preview.photos}} 张图片；整批 {{preview.total}} 道菜谱。</view><view class="form-row"><text>仅恢复文字</text><switch checked="{{textOnly}}" bindchange="textOnly" disabled="{{busy}}" color="#244B3B"/></view><view class="muted">图片需重新审核。历史饭局在文件中保留供查阅，不重开旧饭局，也不恢复旧成员和邀请权限。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="restore" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">开始或继续恢复</button><button wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="link-button" bindtap="history">{{historyExpanded?'收起历史记录':'查看本卷历史记录'}}</button><block wx:if="{{historyExpanded}}"><view class="history-record" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="index"><view class="dish-name">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.dishes}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="muted">我的备注：{{item.note}}</view></view></block></block><button wx:if="{{restoredKitchen}}" class="secondary" bindtap="open">查看恢复的新厨房</button></view></view>
